WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:04.000
I am Atomic. The shadows bow to no one.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:09.500
Within the depths of the void, true power awakens.

00:00:10.500 --> 00:00:14.500
All seven shadows stand prepared for the command.

00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:19.500
Kagemi — Sanctuary of the Shadow Garden.

